 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.what",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.3,
   "text": "What if every person had a number over their head."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.how",
   "start": 2.3,
   "end": 4.6,
   "text": "Not their age. The conversations you have left with them."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.dad",
   "start": 4.6,
   "end": 5.4333,
   "text": "My dad had four."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.classa",
   "start": 5.4333,
   "end": 6.7,
   "text": "I first saw it in maths."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.classb",
   "start": 6.7,
   "end": 8.8667,
   "text": "Twenty-eight numbers, and one of them was a one."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.one",
   "start": 8.8667,
   "end": 11.4,
   "text": "It was over a girl who had never spoken to me."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.rule",
   "start": 11.4,
   "end": 14.0333,
   "text": "The rule was simple. It went down every time we talked."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.limit",
   "start": 14.0333,
   "end": 15.8333,
   "text": "And it never, ever showed my own."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.whya",
   "start": 15.8333,
   "end": 17.0667,
   "text": "I decided that was fair."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.whyb",
   "start": 17.0667,
   "end": 19.2333,
   "text": "I was not the one who was going to run out."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.check",
   "start": 19.2333,
   "end": 20.7333,
   "text": "For a week I did nothing but check."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.luncha",
   "start": 20.7333,
   "end": 21.6667,
   "text": "The cook had a one."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.lunchb",
   "start": 21.6667,
   "end": 23.6,
   "text": "I asked for extra chips and she gave them to me."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.frienda",
   "start": 23.6,
   "end": 25.2,
   "text": "My best friend had four hundred and something."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.friendb",
   "start": 25.2,
   "end": 26.2333,
   "text": "I stopped looking at his."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hall",
   "start": 26.2333,
   "end": 28.9333,
   "text": "The principal had two. I was very polite to the principal."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.sun",
   "start": 28.9333,
   "end": 30.7333,
   "text": "Then I looked at my dad properly."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.four",
   "start": 30.7333,
   "end": 33.8667,
   "text": "Four. Over his head, at the kitchen table, on a Tuesday."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.count",
   "start": 33.8667,
   "end": 36.7,
   "text": "So I started counting us. Every word got expensive."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.small",
   "start": 36.7,
   "end": 39.6,
   "text": "I stopped telling him about school. I was saving him up."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.saya",
   "start": 39.6,
   "end": 42.0667,
   "text": "\"How was your day?\" he said. I said, \"Fine.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.sayb",
   "start": 42.0667,
   "end": 42.8667,
   "text": "That was one."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.scared",
   "start": 42.8667,
   "end": 44.1667,
   "text": "I did not want to waste them."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.avoid",
   "start": 44.1667,
   "end": 46.9,
   "text": "So I stopped talking to him at all, and the number stayed at four."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.fixeda",
   "start": 46.9,
   "end": 48.2,
   "text": "For three weeks it did not move."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.fixedb",
   "start": 48.2,
   "end": 49.4667,
   "text": "I thought I had beaten it."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.mum",
   "start": 49.4667,
   "end": 52.1333,
   "text": "Then my mum said, \"He asks about you every day, you know.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.friend",
   "start": 52.1333,
   "end": 55.2667,
   "text": "My friend said, \"You know it counts when you are not in the room too.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.wait",
   "start": 55.2667,
   "end": 57.8,
   "text": "I said that was not how it worked. I had checked."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.lefta",
   "start": 57.8,
   "end": 60.0,
   "text": "He said, \"You have not checked mine in a month.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.leftb",
   "start": 60.0,
   "end": 61.0,
   "text": "And he was right."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.knock",
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 64.3,
   "text": "On Friday I heard my dad in the hallway, on the phone, saying my name."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.wronga",
   "start": 64.3,
   "end": 66.1,
   "text": "He said I did not want to see him."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.wrongb",
   "start": 66.1,
   "end": 67.8,
   "text": "Which was not true, and was my fault."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.shout",
   "start": 67.8,
   "end": 70.1333,
   "text": "So I shouted at him for saying it. That was two."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.slama",
   "start": 70.1333,
   "end": 71.0667,
   "text": "I slammed my door."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.slamb",
   "start": 71.0667,
   "end": 73.1,
   "text": "In the mirror I could not see a number."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.slamc",
   "start": 73.1,
   "end": 74.2,
   "text": "Of course I could not."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.sunday",
   "start": 74.2,
   "end": 77.1333,
   "text": "Sunday came. He was late. He is always late."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.there",
   "start": 77.1333,
   "end": 80.0333,
   "text": "He was there, in the kitchen, with the coat still on."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.two",
   "start": 80.0333,
   "end": 83.1,
   "text": "Two. Over his head. Two, and he had brought cake."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.real",
   "start": 83.1,
   "end": 87.3333,
   "text": "I had spent two of the four conversations I had left with my dad on being right."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.turna",
   "start": 87.3333,
   "end": 89.1667,
   "text": "So I did the thing I never did."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.turnb",
   "start": 89.1667,
   "end": 90.8667,
   "text": "I looked at the floor and said it."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.truth",
   "start": 90.8667,
   "end": 93.3333,
   "text": "\"I thought if I saved them up, you would stay longer.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "9.four",
   "start": 93.3333,
   "end": 95.4333,
   "text": "He said, \"That is not what the number is.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "9.lista",
   "start": 95.4333,
   "end": 97.2667,
   "text": "The cook's one. The principal's two."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.listb",
   "start": 97.2667,
   "end": 98.9,
   "text": "The four hundred over my friend's head."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.rea",
   "start": 98.9,
   "end": 100.8667,
   "text": "\"It counts the times you speak first,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.reb",
   "start": 100.8667,
   "end": 102.6333,
   "text": "\"It goes up every time you do.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "9.minea",
   "start": 102.6333,
   "end": 105.7,
   "text": "Not conversations left. Conversations I was allowed to start."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.mineb",
   "start": 105.7,
   "end": 107.3,
   "text": "I had been reading it backwards."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.morea",
   "start": 107.3,
   "end": 108.5667,
   "text": "Four was not a countdown."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.moreb",
   "start": 108.5667,
   "end": 111.1667,
   "text": "It was a door, and I had been standing outside it."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.like",
   "start": 111.1667,
   "end": 114.2333,
   "text": "Like this if you ever saved your words up and lost the time instead."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.upa",
   "start": 114.2333,
   "end": 116.2333,
   "text": "I said, \"Dad.\" And the four went up."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.upb",
   "start": 116.2333,
   "end": 117.4667,
   "text": "So I said it again."
  }
 ],
